From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:03:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] dbgeng: data spaces, system objects, client state, control
 and symbols queries (3008)

Implements the parts of the debugger engine that were E_NOTIMPL stubs logging
FIXMEs: WriteVirtual/SearchVirtual and the uncached and pointer variants;
process and thread enumeration, TEB/PEB, handles and exe name for
IDebugSystemObjects; output/input callbacks, masks, width, process options,
exit code and running-process queries for IDebugClient; output, processor
type names, radix, code level, assembly options, system version values and
execution status for IDebugControl; symbol/image/source paths, options and
module lookup by name for IDebugSymbols. IsPointer64Bit is E_UNEXPECTED until
the target is attached. dbgeng.h gets the missing GetCurrentProcessId method
in IDebugSystemObjects{,2,3}, which shifted the vtbl by one.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

